  caseId: 1
  title: Death in the Melaka Room
  briefing: Last night, Datuk Hashim Karim, founder of the Heritage Gallery, was
    found stabbed to death in the Melaka Room with the gallery's own keris. The keris
    is gone from its plinth. He had found out that real pieces were being swapped
    for replicas. Bloody footprints lead from the body towards the entrance. Four
    people had access to the room. Search the scene, tag the evidence, and name the
    person who killed him.
  suspects:
  - id: Y_farid
    displayName: Farid Rahman
    role: Tour guide
    alibi: '"I was in the staff room preparing tomorrow''s tour, 7:30 to 9 pm."'
  - id: Y_tan
    displayName: Mr Tan
    role: Security guard
    alibi: '"I was on gate duty from 8 to 8:40 pm."'
  - id: Y_sofia
    displayName: Dr Sofia Idris
    role: Curator
    alibi: '"I was on a video call with a lender from 7:50 pm."'
  - id: Y_lim
    displayName: Mr Lim
    role: Private collector
    alibi: '"I was having dinner at my hotel from 8 to 9 pm."'
  correctSuspectId: Y_farid
  keyEvidenceIds:
  - Y_K1
  - Y_K2
  - Y_K3
  - Y_K4
